# Where the contact and booking forms POST to.
#
# Any endpoint that accepts a JSON body works — Formspree, Basin, a Cloudflare
# Worker, your own API. The payload looks like:
#
#   { "form": "contact", "name": "...", "email": "...", "message": "..." }
#   { "form": "booking", "name": "...", "email": "...", "date": "2026-09-15", "time": "10:30" }
#
# Leave it unset and the forms fall back to opening the visitor's mail client
# with everything pre-filled, so a message still reaches info@hinit.nl. Nothing
# is ever silently dropped.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.production` (git-ignored) before deploying.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
